  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>CREATE 6.0 與任務！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">此整合包匯聚了最優質的 Create 模組，為您帶來在 Minecraft 中體驗工程與自動化的獨特樂趣。探索建造複雜機械與自動化系統的新方法，徹底改造您的世界。憑藉創新的工具，您可以無限制地設計與實驗。準備好使用頂級的 Create 模組，將您的創意推向全新境界吧！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">此整合包匯聚了最優質的 Create 模組，讓您沉浸於一個充滿無限可能的世界，在這裡工程、自動化與創意皆無界限。打造令人驚嘆的機械，自動化處理複雜任務，並運用創新工具改造您的世界。從先進的交通運輸系統到精密的自動化工廠，本整合包提供了一切所需，讓您在獨特且動態的環境中自由設計與實驗。非常適合多人遊玩，您可以與朋友合作，共同創造驚人的工程項目。釋放您的創意，使用頂級的 Create 模組將您的世界打造成工程奇蹟！</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_promo2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"251\"></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>立即擁有屬於自己的 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">並與朋友享受無限冒險！我們的伺服器具備頂尖效能與穩定運行時間，保證為所有人提供流暢愉快的遊戲體驗。使用優惠碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>即可享有 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">25% 折扣！</span></strong></a></span></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1178965/description_f03a1a34-ef08-4d7a-8a27-b1d877043ea9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1178965/description_f9433999-ddde-439b-b599-e3c99af5edbb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1178965/description_6f58d2df-5039-4f7d-94d9-1cdb3c34257e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></a></p>",
